00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:10,800
Return to the Overlook.

2
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:15,600
Doctor Sleep is a horror, fantasy film directed by Mike Flanagan.

3
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:20,400
Still scarred by the trauma he endured as a child at the Overlook Hotel, Dan Torrance faces the ghosts of the past when he meets Abra, a
courageous teen who desperately needs his help -- and who possesses a powerful extrasensory ability called the "shine".

4
